 "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there,\nThank you for your appeal! I'd be happy for you to draw Tiona.\nShe is a half succubus, half oni from the countryside. Her immense height (230cm) comes from her oni side and her very voluptuous body is from her succubus side. Despite being so tall and having an extremely sexy body, she is extremely timid and kind hearted. She swaps to a much more assertive personality when her succubus blood awakens and her second horn pops out.\nFeel free to draw her however you wish based on the description.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nTiona: https://photos.app.goo.gl/LETe7irs1cRXcwW9A", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zurataner/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db9688cf/uploads/origins/10891cea-7500-49bd-8323-d5c6dda45d32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25c32288862ee1f37ae27587b1c849d1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db9688cf/uploads/origins/10891cea-7500-49bd-8323-d5c6dda45d32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25c32288862ee1f37ae27587b1c849d1, https://si.imgix.net/db9688cf/uploads/origins/10891cea-7500-49bd-8323-d5c6dda45d32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4107ebec27a4f9bb4ec1d953c70e5107 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db9688cf/uploads/origins/10891cea-7500-49bd-8323-d5c6dda45d32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45d8d4bc1282e4aedfa87de93fb9a0cf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！アピールありがとうございます！私のOCを描いてくれますか？\n\n彼女の詳細設定：\n【年齢】：17歳\n【身長】：168cm\n【髪色】: 銀白\n【目の色、形】: 紫色、お目々ぱっちり系の猫目\n【性格】: 魔性の女です、性格には猫っぽくてマイペース\n【バスト】：Cカップくらい\n\nすべてお任せします。可能であれば、psdファイルにキャラクターのみのレイヤーを入れてほしい。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10jLbolqRuL_FQhsOlYa4kT9y3bKsDjm6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zurataner/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/224d7089/uploads/origins/